93
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:23,000
Whereas the city council and mayor of the city of Huntsville, Alabama,

94
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:28,000
wish to recognize the month of May 2026 as ALS awareness month,

95
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:32,000
acknowledging the thousands of Americans who are affected by the fatal disease

96
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:35,000
and advocating for increased awareness research and funding.

97
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:42,000
And whereas amyotrophic lateral sclerosis, you can see why they call it ALS,

98
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:47,000
also commonly known as Lou Gehrig's disease is a progressive fatal neurodegenerative disease.

99
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:51,000
And whereas thousands of ALS cases are reported each year.

100
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:58,000
Whereas on average patients diagnosed with ALS survive only two to five years from the time of diagnosis.

101
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:04,000
And even though the exact cause of ALS is unknown, there is no cure for ALS.

102
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:09,000
It has been clinically proven that individuals who have served in the military are more likely

103
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:12,000
to develop ALS and succumb to the disease.

104
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:18,000
Whereas due to this uncertain causes and undeveloped cures, securing access to new therapies,

105
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:25,000
durable medical equipment and communication technologies is of vital importance to people living with ALS.

106
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:36,000
Additionally, clinical trials play a pivotal role in treatments enhancing quality of life

107
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:39,000
and fostering assistive technologies.

108
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:46,000
Whereas supporting such efforts, the ALS Association is the largest philanthropic funder of ALS research globally

109
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:54,000
and has committed more than $154 million to support more than 550 projects across the United States

110
00:11:54,000 --> 00:12:04,000
and 18 countries demonstrating an unwavering commitment to make ALS livable and curable for everyone everywhere.

111
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:11,000
Whereas Amy atrophic lateral sclerosis awareness month provides an opportunity to increase public awareness

112
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:16,000
of the dire circumstances of people living with ALS.

113
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:21,000
Now therefore be it resolved that the city council and mayor of the city of Huntsville, Alabama

114
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:27,000
do hereby recognize the month of May 2026 as ALS awareness month.

115
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:35,000
May this resolution serve as a call to action to all Americans to join supporting ALS research,

116
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:42,000
advocating for increased funding and standing in solidarity with those affected by this relentless disease.

