01:01:18,000 --> 01:01:40,000
Yeah, so I had three notes and if I need to expand Councilmember, just point them out to me. So Mill Creek, so Mill Creek is under construction, so if you pass by Governor's Drive you'll actually see the site where the first building pad, so they're digging footings and foundations and you'll see steel start rising up as we get into the summer months.

